menu "Round display link"

config DISPLAY_ESPNOW
    bool "Stream telemetry to the paired round display over ESP-NOW"
    default n
    help
        Starts Wi-Fi in station mode (no access point connection) and sends
        one encrypted ESP-NOW telemetry v1 snapshot every 50 ms to the
        display saved by pairing. Runs alongside the companion BLE link
        through Wi-Fi/BT coexistence. Without a saved pairing, Wi-Fi is not
        started. CAN stays listen-only; this sends no vehicle traffic.

endmenu
